OL,3,CMan charged after boy, 9, left in
OL,4,Ccritical condition following crash
OL,6,FA man has been charged with causing
OL,7,Fserious injury by dangerous driving
OL,8,Fafter a 9-year-old boy was left in a
OL,9,Fcritical condition following a crash
OL,10,Fin Birmingham.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to
OL,13,FMasshouse Lane at the junction of
OL,14,FShannon Road in Kings Norton at around
OL,15,F5.55pm on Tuesday (July 28th) to
OL,16,Freports of a collision involving a VW
OL,17,FTiguan and a Renault Scenic.
OL,19,FThe boy who was in the Renault was
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital and remains in a
OL,21,Fcritical condition.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
