OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785415712
OL,3,CMan charged after boy, 9, left in
OL,4,Ccritical condition following crash
OL,6,FThe Renault driver, a woman in her
OL,7,F60s, was also injured and is
OL,8,Frecovering from her injuries.
OL,10,FJames Connors, 32, is accused of two
OL,11,Fcounts of causing serious injury by
OL,12,Fdangerous driving, dangerous driving,
OL,13,Fand driving while disqualified and
OL,14,Fwithout insurance.
OL,16,FConnors was remanded in custody to
OL,17,Fappear before magistrates in
OL,18,FBirmingham on Thursday (July 30th).
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
