OL,3,CMan charged after boy, 9, left in
OL,4,Ccritical condition following crash
OL,6,FWest Midlands Police are appealing to
OL,7,Fanyone who was in the area just before
OL,8,Fand around the time of the collision
OL,9,Fand in particular anyone who has any
OL,10,Fdash-cam footage to get in touch.
